---
import { SITE } from '@/data/site';
---

<section class="section bg-black" aria-label="Guarantee">
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Risk-free</p>

    <h2 class="headline text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">
      The {SITE.bootcamp.durationDays}-Day<br />
      Bootcamp <span class="text-blood">Guarantee</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="mt-8 rounded-xl border border-sand/20 bg-sand/5 p-8 text-left md:p-12">
      <p class="text-lg text-bone">Here's my side of the deal.</p>

      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-base text-stone">
        <p>Do the missions. Film your form on Wednesdays. Test yourself on Saturdays. Show up for 60 days.</p>
        <p>If you do all that and your max hasn't moved by Day 60, I don't disappear. I coach you 1-on-1 for 30 more days. No extra cost.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-stone/60">
      I won't promise you a number. Nobody honest can. What I promise is I don't quit on you while you're still working.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
